WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.929
Dentist and Eye Clinic.

2
00:00:02.209 --> 00:00:06.518
Day 43 of the Soft Skill Playbook course, in the Everyday Life phase.

3
00:00:08.268 --> 00:00:09.292
The key idea.

4
00:00:09.572 --> 00:00:16.932
Today's goal: book appointments, describe tooth and eye problems, understand the treatment, and ask about cost and aftercare.

5
00:00:18.282 --> 00:00:19.135
Part 1.

6
00:00:19.415 --> 00:00:20.375
Key words.

7
00:00:21.625 --> 00:00:22.991
Here is a quick table:

8
00:00:23.271 --> 00:00:41.148
Dentist, and Eye clinic. toothache or sensitivity or cavity: blurry or blurred vision, eye strain. filling or root canal or extraction: eye test or power or prescription. cleaning or scaling: glasses or spectacles or frames or lenses. gums (bleeding,

9
00:00:41.428 --> 00:00:49.684
swollen): contact lenses or anti-glare coating. wisdom tooth or braces or crown: dry eyes or itching or redness.

10
00:00:49.964 --> 00:00:54.956
X-ray or numb or anaesthetic: near-sighted (can't see far) / far-sighted.

11
00:00:56.306 --> 00:00:57.181
Part 2.

12
00:00:57.461 --> 00:00:58.677
Questions you'll ask.

13
00:00:59.927 --> 00:01:00.780
Dentist.

14
00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:03.535
Can I get an appointment for a check-up this week?

15
00:01:03.815 --> 00:01:04.711
Will it hurt?

16
00:01:04.991 --> 00:01:06.591
Will you give me an injection?

17
00:01:06.871 --> 00:01:09.345
Do I need a root canal, or is a filling enough?

18
00:01:09.625 --> 00:01:11.183
How many sittings will it take?

19
00:01:11.463 --> 00:01:12.743
How much will it cost?

20
00:01:13.023 --> 00:01:14.601
Is it covered by insurance?

21
00:01:14.881 --> 00:01:16.737
When can I eat after the treatment?

22
00:01:18.087 --> 00:01:18.983
Eye clinic.

23
00:01:19.263 --> 00:01:20.586
I'd like an eye test.

24
00:01:20.866 --> 00:01:22.253
Do I need an appointment?

25
00:01:22.533 --> 00:01:23.898
Has my power changed?

26
00:01:24.178 --> 00:01:28.274
Do I need to wear glasses all the time, or only for reading or screens?

27
00:01:28.554 --> 00:01:30.538
What's the difference between these lenses?

28
00:01:30.818 --> 00:01:33.058
How long will the glasses take to be ready?

29
00:01:33.338 --> 00:01:35.642
Are these drops safe with contact lenses?

30
00:01:36.992 --> 00:01:37.888
Part 3.

31
00:01:38.168 --> 00:01:40.323
Conversation 1: at the dentist.

32
00:01:41.573 --> 00:01:43.599
Here is how the conversation goes.

33
00:01:43.879 --> 00:01:45.565
What seems to be the problem?

34
00:01:45.845 --> 00:01:48.810
I have pain in a lower back tooth on the right side.

35
00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:51.138
It hurts when I drink something cold.

36
00:01:51.418 --> 00:01:53.125
How long has it been like this?

37
00:01:53.405 --> 00:01:54.770
About two weeks.

38
00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:56.373
It's getting worse.

39
00:01:57.723 --> 00:01:59.323
The conversation continues.

40
00:01:59.603 --> 00:02:00.968
Let me take a look...

41
00:02:01.248 --> 00:02:02.677
There's a deep cavity.

42
00:02:02.957 --> 00:02:04.728
We'll take an X-ray to check.

43
00:02:05.008 --> 00:02:06.757
Will I need a root canal?

44
00:02:07.037 --> 00:02:09.576
If the X-ray shows the nerve is affected, yes.

45
00:02:09.856 --> 00:02:11.584
Otherwise, a filling will do.

46
00:02:11.864 --> 00:02:16.216
How many sittings does a root canal take, and how much does it cost?

47
00:02:17.566 --> 00:02:19.166
The conversation continues.

48
00:02:19.446 --> 00:02:21.153
Usually two or three sittings.

49
00:02:21.433 --> 00:02:25.486
It's about 6,000, rupeesplus 8,000 rupeesfor the crown.

50
00:02:25.766 --> 00:02:26.705
Okay.

51
00:02:26.985 --> 00:02:28.073
Will it hurt?

52
00:02:28.353 --> 00:02:30.337
No, we'll make the area numb first.

53
00:02:30.617 --> 00:02:32.217
You'll only feel some pressure.

54
00:02:32.497 --> 00:02:34.502
Alright, let's do the X-ray.

55
00:02:35.852 --> 00:02:36.769
Part 4.

56
00:02:37.049 --> 00:02:39.695
Conversation 2: eye test and glasses.

57
00:02:40.945 --> 00:02:42.971
Here is how the conversation goes.

58
00:02:43.251 --> 00:02:45.385
Please read the smallest line you can see.

59
00:02:45.665 --> 00:02:48.929
E, F, P... sorry, the next line is blurry.

60
00:02:49.209 --> 00:02:50.318
Okay.

61
00:02:50.598 --> 00:02:53.158
Do you find it hard to see far away, or close up?

62
00:02:53.438 --> 00:02:54.547
Far away.

63
00:02:54.827 --> 00:02:57.537
Road signs are blurry when I drive at night.

64
00:02:57.817 --> 00:03:00.227
And my eyes get tired after work.

65
00:03:00.507 --> 00:03:04.539
Your power has increased slightly, to minus 1.5 in both eyes.

66
00:03:05.889 --> 00:03:07.489
The conversation continues.

67
00:03:07.769 --> 00:03:10.372
Do I need to wear glasses all the time?

68
00:03:10.652 --> 00:03:12.465
For driving and screens, yes.

69
00:03:12.745 --> 00:03:15.199
I'd suggest lenses with a blue-light filter.

70
00:03:15.479 --> 00:03:18.615
How much do they cost, and when will they be ready?

71
00:03:18.895 --> 00:03:22.479
3,500 rupeesfor the lenses, plus the frame.

72
00:03:22.759 --> 00:03:24.465
They'll be ready in three days.

73
00:03:24.745 --> 00:03:27.327
Can I also get a copy of the prescription?

74
00:03:28.677 --> 00:03:30.277
The conversation continues.

75
00:03:30.557 --> 00:03:31.474
Of course.

76
00:03:32.824 --> 00:03:33.784
Part 5.

77
00:03:34.064 --> 00:03:34.981
Practice.

78
00:03:36.231 --> 00:03:42.525
Describe a health problem using: where it hurts + what kind of pain + since when + what makes it worse.

79
00:03:43.875 --> 00:03:44.792
Success:

80
00:03:45.072 --> 00:03:46.160
Sample answer.

81
00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:49.341
I have a sharp pain in my upper left tooth since Monday.

82
00:03:49.621 --> 00:03:51.456
It's worse when I eat something sweet.

83
00:03:52.806 --> 00:03:53.745
Part 6.

84
00:03:54.025 --> 00:03:55.070
Speak today.

85
00:03:56.320 --> 00:03:59.499
Book (or practise booking) a check-up appointment in English.

86
00:03:59.779 --> 00:04:02.531
Learn 3 questions to ask about cost and time.

87
00:04:03.881 --> 00:04:05.417
That's the end of this lesson.

88
00:04:05.697 --> 00:04:10.369
Pick one script from it, say it out loud three times, and use it for real today.

89
00:04:10.649 --> 00:04:16.750
For extra practice, paste the Master Prompt into an AI assistant and role-play the conversation.

